  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Climate ans security mechanism established by UNDPPA, UNDP and UNEP. The project will enhance the UN&apos;s capacity to address climate-related security risks. Continuation of previous agreement: QZA-19/0217 but now with MPTFO as pass through mechanism for the four UN institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
